Local compatibility patch for rapid reconnect on one fixed ICE port.
The previous passive connection can remain in TCP TIME_WAIT after revoke.
SO_REUSEADDR permits rebinding after teardown; SO_REUSEPORT is not enabled.

--- a/socket/tcp-passive.c
+++ b/socket/tcp-passive.c
@@ -133 +133 @@
-  gret = g_socket_bind (gsock, gaddr, FALSE, error) &&
+  gret = g_socket_bind (gsock, gaddr, TRUE, error) &&
